s&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qUTM2FTZ9zEQ7kNvwEn4sql&_nc_oc=AdounNxO0Ba3Z4BHSMmOKFqHvsfrU_v4-twSblPA-0Rv2_Mit6imxrbN19lAMTaFRUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTrbYMKbP7D1aQoCMYYJ5m2eejyc4eWzKeduSzGKEDNPA&oe=6B0B276A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Drum Circle Cover Art (2560 x 1440 px) (1).png", "id": "1161447404916858", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982625_1161447408250191_2650284731583729103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-lGD74PsUm8Q7kNvwFnZ6NK&_nc_oc=AdrxbwyEw89OtEDS5r4p4yB1e_QGAmiuBUnhGk_RopaB7TTBH5fyWLP9yh1Yoak79hg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ0b-md_2nOXM_Pwfai_jnfqxKYvFERlgmufmWtBEhl-Q&oe=6B0B2902"}, "display_name": "Drum Circle", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unleash your inner musician with *Drum Circle*! Step into a vibrant virtual world where you can play a variety of instruments using just your hands. Whether you're grooving on the conga drums, tapping out rhythms on the bongos, creating melodies on a keyboard, or shaking maracas to the beat, *Drum Circle* brings the joy of music-making to life in immersive VR.\n\n**Features:**\n- Play a range of instruments: congas, bongos, keyboards, and maracas!\n- Play along with *music tracks* or create your own rhythms and melodies\n- Intuitive hand-tracking lets you perform naturally without controllers.\n\nGet ready to feel the rhythm, unleash your creativity, and make music like never before with *Drum Circle*!", "short_description": "Unleash your inner musician with Drum Circle! Step into a vibrant virtual world where you can play a variety of instruments using just your hands. Whether you're grooving on the conga drums, tapping out rhythms on the bongos, creating melodies on a keyboard, or shaking maracas to the beat, Drum Circle brings the joy of music-making to life in immersive VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "